   "text": "It's going to be a different feeling, … Obviously, it's going to be a bit overwhelming as well, even though I've already gone through my comeback and getting back to the Tour. But I think that's part of it. It's not Stockholm's fault that I got injured. I love the tournament and have great memories of winning there in the past. I just want to come back, give a massive effort and hopefully do well.",
